WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.763
Welcome.

2
00:00:00.763 --> 00:00:06.074
This is Part 1 of the technical deep dive
for the Federal Modernization Workbook's

3
00:00:06.074 --> 00:00:09.746
companion guide, Attribute-Driven
Migration to Entra ID,

4
00:00:09.746 --> 00:00:13.574
for the engineers, administrators
and I S S O's who will run it.

5
00:00:13.574 --> 00:00:15.037
The idea is simple.

6
00:00:15.037 --> 00:00:19.812
In Active Directory, where an object sat
in the tree decided what applied to it.

7
00:00:19.812 --> 00:00:23.624
In Entra ID, what the object
says about itself decides.

8
00:00:23.624 --> 00:00:25.700
The deep dive is split by track.

9
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:29.025
This part is the model and
the HR track, the people.

10
00:00:29.025 --> 00:00:33.250
Part 2 is devices, servers
and non-person identities.

11
00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:34.560
Let's start with why.
